@startuml
 title GPS signal loss alert
autonumber
participant "Temporizador of signal" as Timer
participant "gps-service" as GPS
queue Kafka
participant "notification-service" as NTF
participant "Proveedor push" as Push
actor Guardian

Timer -> GPS: queries last position
GPS -> GPS: Evalúa threshold of signal
alt within of the threshold
  GPS -> GPS: Continúa monitoreo
else is supera the threshold
  GPS -> Kafka: publishes loss of signal
  Kafka -> NTF: delivery evento
  NTF -> NTF: creates alert
  NTF -> Push: sends last position known
  Push -> Guardian: alert without signal
end
@enduml

